[I] A CLI app to enumerates all OpenCL properties and devices

[T] Clinfo is a simple command-line application that enumerates all possible
[T] (known) properties of the OpenCL platform and devices available on the
[T] system. It tries to output all possible information, including those
[T] provided by platform-specific extensions.

[U] https://github.com/Oblomov/clinfo

